    },
    "description": {
     "value": "<p>The yeti targets one creature it can see within 30 feet of it. If the target can see the yeti, the target must succeed on a [[/save con 13]]{DC 13} Constitution saving throw against this magic or take 10 ([[/damage 3d6 type=cold]]{3d6}) cold damage and then be &amp;Reference[condition=paralyzed]{paralyzed} for 1 minute, unless it is immune to cold damage. The target can repeat the saving throw at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success. If the target's saving throw is successful, or if the effect ends on it, the target is immune to the Chilling Gaze of all yetis (but not abominable yetis) for 1 hour.</p>",
     "chat": ""
    },
